### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### RESPONSES WORKFLOW - Transaction System
### Base Route: api/Responses
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@responseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@responderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requesterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET RESPONSE BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/{{responseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET PAGED RESPONSES
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/paged?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET RESPONSES BY REQUEST ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/by-request/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. GET RESPONSES BY RESPONDER ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/by-responder/{{responderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. GET RESPONSES BY REQUESTER ID (paged)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/by-requester/{{requesterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. CREATE RESPONSE (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RequestId"

{{requestId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Content"

Response content here
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="response-file.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./response-file.pdf
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. UPDATE RESPONSE
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/{{responseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated response content"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. DELETE RESPONSE
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/{{responseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. ADD FILES TO RESPONSE (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Responses/AddFilesToResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="responseId"

{{responseId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="additional-file.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./additional-file.pdf
------Boundary--
